📝 USER STORY:
As a Chauffeur
I want to list vehicle accessories and equipment on the marketplace
So that other chauffeurs in my network can browse and purchase them

📋 BUSINESS RULES & PAYLOAD SPECIFICATIONS:
• Endpoint: POST /api/v1/items
• Authentication: Bearer JWT Token required
• Mandatory Fields:
  - title (string): Descriptive title of the listing
  - price (number): Must be a positive amount (> 0)
  - location (string): Physical location or pickup area
• Available Condition Types (Optional field):
  1. "New"         - Brand new in box / unopened original packaging
  2. "Used"        - Pre-owned / gently used equipment
  3. "Refurbished" - Factory serviced or restored electronics
• Optional Fields:
  - description (string): Extended item specifications and details
  - photos (string[]): Array of image URLs (up to 5)
• System Initialized Values:
  - status: "AVAILABLE" (default)
  - createdBy: Logged-in user's ObjectId reference

